<!-- ========================
     THE PROBLEM
======================== -->
<section class="problem" id="problem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="gold-rule"></div>
    <div class="fade-in">
      <span class="eyebrow center-block">Why Sankalp</span>
      <h2 class="section-title center-block" style="max-width:680px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">The apps you&rsquo;ve tried<br>didn&rsquo;t know your body.</h2>
      <div class="problem-hook">
        <p class="problem-line">You&rsquo;ve downloaded the meditation apps. Done the 7-day streaks. Tried the diets.</p>
        <p class="problem-line">None of them asked what your body already knows &mdash; what you&rsquo;re made of, what you&rsquo;re running from, what your breath is telling you.</p>
        <p class="problem-punchline">Sankalp does.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gold-rule gold-rule-bottom"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================
     HOW IT WORKS
======================== -->
<section class="how-it-works" id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fade-in">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Journey</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Three steps. One intention.</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-grid fade-in">

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number">01 &middot; <span class="dev">&#2360;&#2369;&#2344;&#2344;&#2366;</span></span>
        <h3>We hear you first</h3>
        <p>Tell us your story in your own words &mdash; how you sleep, eat, feel and live. No checkboxes. Just you.</p>
        <a href="prakriti-assessment.html" class="step-link">Begin your profile &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number">02 &middot; <span class="dev">&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367;</span></span>
        <h3>We read your design</h3>
        <p>Your Prakriti &mdash; your original constitution of Vata, Pitta and Kapha. The blueprint you were born with, confirmed by modern science.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number">03 &middot; <span class="dev">&#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367;</span></span>
        <h3>We find the drift</h3>
        <p>The gap between who you are and how you&rsquo;re living &mdash; your Vikriti. That gap is the diagnosis, and the first step of your daily practice.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================
     FEATURE SHOWCASE
======================== -->
<section class="features" id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fade-in">
      <span class="eyebrow">Inside the App</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">What&rsquo;s inside</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid fade-in">

      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">&#127749;</span>
        <h3>Today&rsquo;s Sadhana</h3>
        <p>Your personalized morning practice. Breathwork, asana, and meditation &mdash; sequenced for your dosha, your imbalance, and the season you&rsquo;re in.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">&#127758;</span>
        <h3>Pranayama Library</h3>
        <p>20+ breathing techniques. Each one mapped to a symptom, a nervous system state, and a healing outcome. Breath is the switch &mdash; we show you how to use it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">&#10022;</span>
        <h3>Streak &amp; Continuity</h3>
        <p>Ancient wisdom knew: 40 days changes the body. Track your practice, honor your commitment, and build the habit that finally stays.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">&#129295;</span>
        <h3>Sankalp AI Companion</h3>
        <p>Ask anything about your health. Get answers rooted in both Ayurveda and modern science. Not generic advice &mdash; answers that know your Prakriti.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

